  "description": "EXIKED crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C156 H106 Eu4 F6 N12 O16. From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 6 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 6 O neighbors; Eu4 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.614-3.920 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.10-112.00°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C156H106Eu4F6N12O16. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
